  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans) of planning permission reference 25/3534/S73 (Variation of 24/1998/FUL) dated 17/12/25 for 'Amalgamation to recreate a single dwelling, together with refurbishment involving internal and external alterations (including removal of later additions and extensions), ground floor conservatory extension, extension to the lower ground floor, creation of a new partial basement and roof extension to recreate a second floor and other associated development including landscaping.' Variation to include internal and external changes. External works include: Alterations to rear garden pool shape; Revision to the planting around the pool in the front garden; Addition of pool plantroom under rear terrace area/behind retaining wall; Alteration to staircase to car parking area in front landscape; Alterations to conservatory windows; Renewal of Chantry front porch paving. Repairs to outer steps and door threshold; Changes to porch roof and rainwater goods; Front facade railings to be dismantled, repaired, and rebuilt; New cast iron grilles installed at lower ground floor front elevation; Internal works to include changes to layouts, internal doors and stairs and replacement of ceilings; Installation of underfloor heating; Installation of new panelling; Changes to roof including: Revised PV layout; Revised plant layout including installation of condenser units",
